    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the study of the late cryptographer Elias Thorne. The room is dimly lit, filled with strange mechanical devices and thick layers of dust. The authorities believe Thorne hid the ultimate secret society roster in this very room before his disappearance. Your objective is to follow his trail of clues, activate the dormant machinery, and finally extract the roster from his antique typewriter. You have exactly one hour before the building is demolished. Look carefully—every device is connected, and the output of one often serves as the key to another. Will you uncover the truth?",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
